STATUS SURFACE
  vision_status now prints a line for the new route, so any conversation can check it in one call:
      uncensored: D:\AI_file\models\qwen-image-2.1-uncensored [present]

KNOWN LIMITS, STATED PLAINLY
  - Slow: 85 s at 512x512/20 steps, about 5-6 min at 1024x1024. FLUX is 13-18 s.
  - No vision weights were downloaded, so this is text-to-image only; image editing is unavailable.
  - The tool serialises calls behind a lock: one generation at a time, because the GPU and the RAM are
    shared. Two concurrent calls would thrash rather than parallelise.
  - Licence remains research-only. Anything meant for publication or sale should use FLUX.